WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.001
A school

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:01.801
shooting in Serbia's

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.136
capital, Belgrade, has left

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:04.004
eight children

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.772
and the security guard dead.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:06.773
Serbian officials

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.842
say the alleged shooter is a 14 year

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:09.843
old student.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.144
He's now in custody,

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.079
according to the Interior Ministry.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:15.115
Another seven people are hospitalized.

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:16.449
Stop the plane.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.184
Following all these developments for us.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.486
What happened is not sort of

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.621
sorry we hear from Serbia very often.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:22.255
It's certainly not

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:23.490
and especially not from this school,

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.558
which is in an upscale part of Belgrade,

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:26.893
one of the most famous schools

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:27.460
in the city.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.695
But we know that this happened around

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.729
eight 40 in the morning

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.197
according to the authorities.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:31.664
Police,

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:32.032
there was

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.733
obviously a massive police response

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.668
when this 14 year old boy

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.638
walked into this school with two pistols,

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:39.672
a nine millimeter

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.074
and a smaller gauge pistol,

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.442
and started shooting.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:43.443
Police also said

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.245
that he had four Molotov cocktails

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:45.812
with him.

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:46.880
When police got to him,

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.948
he was actually in the school yard.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.283
So what we know about injuries

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:50.784
right now

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:52.052
is that there were nine

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:52.919
killed, eight of them

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.554
kids, one a security guard.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.688
There are seven people

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:56.823
injured, six of them

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:57.757
children, one of them

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:58.658
a teacher,

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.261
a 53 year old, we understand,

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.029
suffering from gunshot wounds

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:05.765
to her stomach and her hands as well.

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:07.834
There is also one girl

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:09.969
that at last word was undergoing

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.072
life threatening surgery

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.541
inside of the hospital.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:16.209
As I said, this is a 14 year old boy.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:17.110
So seventh grade,

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:17.911
there was a picture of him

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.112
coming out of the school there.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.513
They only identified him

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.549
thus far by his initials, k. K.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.684
He had a jacket over his head.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.585
Skinny jeans on.

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.353
He got into an unmarked police car

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:29.055
and was taken away

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:29.989
Shortly after that,

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.425
we also saw students or at some point

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.094
we saw students also coming out.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.929
Some of them were quite visibly

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:36.596
distraught

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.931
as they were coming out of the school.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.432
One girl was in tears.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.401
A mother told our local affiliate

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.302
there that

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.870
her daughter is frankly in shock.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.272
She cannot get her to calm down

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:47.340
right now.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:47.807
There's a press

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:48.908
conference happening right now

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.343
with with authorities

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:51.811
from government and from police.

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:52.412
And police

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:52.979
have described

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:53.880
this as something

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.148
that was being planned

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:56.883
for more than a month now.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:58.451
They said that the shooter had a plan

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:01.921
as to which specific classrooms to go to.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.423
Apparently, the history one was chosen

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:04.724
because it was near to the door

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:06.593
which specific students to go after.

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:07.494
And so this seems like

00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:08.628
something is preplanned

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.996
One official blamed

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:11.931
the influence of Internet

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:12.699
video games

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:15.001
so far as sort of an initial cause.

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:17.070
The gun came from where

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.905
and how common a guns that. Yeah.

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:20.974
So initially

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:21.774
the initial report

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:22.275
at least,

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.576
is that these are guns

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:24.544
that were taken

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:25.678
by this 14 year

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.847
old student from his father.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.282
So guns

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:31.017
are not nearly as common in Serbia

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:31.518
as they are

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:32.519
in, say, the United States,

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:33.153
which is why you don't

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.954
hear this kind of thing from Serbia.

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.257
It's also a very small country,

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:39.559
but there are also strict gun laws.

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:41.461
You in order to get one,

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.929
you can only get a semiautomatic.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.030
Automatic guns are banned,

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:44.931
but in order to get one,

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:45.765
you basically have to go through

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:46.566
a medical exam.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:47.500
You have to go through a background

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.001
check.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:48.835
You have to have a reason

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:49.869
to have one likes

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:52.071
for hunting or a good reason

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:53.406
to feel like you're under threat.

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:54.841
And you also have to do

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:55.909
a training course.

00:02:55.909 --> 00:02:57.277
There's also lots of guns though.

00:02:57.277 --> 00:02:58.378
Left were left around

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:01.080
from the Civil War back in the nineties.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.383
And so one estimate from 2018

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.685
suggested that Serbia actually

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:06.786
per 100 people

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:07.587
had the third

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:09.589
highest rates of civilian guns

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:11.324
floating around there.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:14.194
The number is 39 per 100 people.

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:15.195
But just for comparison's

00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:15.428
sake,

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:19.299
the US number is 120 guns per 100 people.

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:21.734
So obviously not nearly as common,

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.603
but one of the more commonplace

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:24.571
is to find guns,

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:26.339
certainly in Europe and the world

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:27.407
Okay, Scott, thank you.

